stop_result_as_it_stands_on_loser.cardlang:7:3: error: `as it stands` reads the game's `winner:` clause at the stop, and this game declares `loser:` which a stopped game has not decided: at a Length Stop it would name nobody, several seats, or the wrong one. Declare `at max_length: tie` — every seat a winner — or rank a state variable the game keeps: `at max_length: lowest <variable>`.
